{
  "title": "It Was A Long Time Coming: Our New Home In Pewaukee",
  "date": "2022-07-06T17:41:07",
  "excerpt": "After 22 years in our charming but cramped Waukesha brewery, we decided it was time to move and expand our exotic and classic car restoration mastery.",
  "byline": "Matt Backhaus",
